{"seq":1,"slug":"traits-and-generics","title":"Trait 与泛型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/type-system/traits-and-generics","wordCount":881,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"trait-与泛型\">Trait 与泛型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Trait 定义&quot;一个类型能做什么&quot;，泛型让&quot;同一段代码适用于多种类型&quot;，两者结合构成 Rust 的抽象骨架。理解本篇的关键，是意识到它们都在回答同一个问题——<strong>如何在编译期确定调用哪段具体代码</strong>，而 <code>impl Trait</code> 与 <code>dyn Trait</code> 只是这个问题的两种答案。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>约束优于继承</strong>：Trait 只描述能力，不建立类型层级，因此类型可以自由实现多个互不相关的 Trait。</li>\n<li><strong>关联类型表达&quot;每个实现只有一种映射&quot;</strong>，泛型参数则允许每个类型有多个实现，这是 <code>Iterator</code> 与 <code>From&lt;T&gt;</code> 的设计分野。</li>\n<li><strong>静态分发在编译期单态化</strong>，零开销但可能膨胀二进制；<strong>动态分发用虚表</strong>，体积更小但有间接调用成本。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"trait-基础\">Trait 基础</h2><p>Trait 是 Rust 的核心抽象机制，定义了一组类型必须实现的行为。类似于其他语言中的接口，但 Trait 更强大——支持默认实现、关联类型和 blanket implementation。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"trait Summary {&#10;    fn summarize_author(&amp;self) -&gt; String;&#10;&#10;    fn summarize(&amp;self) -&gt; String {&#10;        format!(&quot;(阅读 {} 的更多内容...)&quot;, self.summarize_author())&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct Article {&#10;    title: String,&#10;    author: String,&#10;    content: String,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl Summary for Article {&#10;    fn summarize_author(&amp;self) -&gt; String {&#10;        self.author.clone()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fn summarize(&amp;self) -&gt; String {&#10;        format!(&quot;{}, 作者 {}&quot;, self.title, self.author)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>trait Summary {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn summarize_author(&#x26;self) -> String;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn summarize(&#x26;self) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        format!(\"(阅读 {} 的更多内容...)\", self.summarize_author())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Article {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    title: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    author: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    content: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Summary for Article {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn summarize_author(&#x26;self) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.author.clone()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn summarize(&#x26;self) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        format!(\"{}, 作者 {}\", self.title, self.author)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"泛型与-trait-bound\">泛型与 Trait Bound</h2><p>泛型允许编写适用于多种类型的代码，Trait Bound 约束泛型参数必须实现特定的 Trait。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn print_summary&lt;T: Summary&gt;(item: &amp;T) {&#10;    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, item.summarize());&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn notify(item: &amp;(impl Summary + std::fmt::Display)) {&#10;    println!(&quot;速报: {}&quot;, item);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn print_summary&#x3C;T: Summary>(item: &#x26;T) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}\", item.summarize());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn notify(item: &#x26;(impl Summary + std::fmt::Display)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"速报: {}\", item);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"trait-bound-的三种写法\">Trait Bound 的三种写法</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>impl Trait</code></td>\n<td><code>fn f(x: &amp;impl Summary)</code></td>\n<td>简单场景，参数位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泛型 + Bound</td>\n<td><code>fn f&lt;T: Summary&gt;(x: &amp;T)</code></td>\n<td>需要多处使用同一类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>where</code> 子句</td>\n<td><code>fn f&lt;T&gt;(x: &amp;T) where T: Summary</code></td>\n<td>复杂约束，保持签名清晰</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::fmt::{Debug, Display};&#10;&#10;fn complex_function&lt;T, U&gt;(t: &amp;T, u: &amp;U) -&gt; String&#10;where&#10;    T: Display + Clone,&#10;    U: Debug + Summary,&#10;{&#10;    format!(&quot;{} - {:?}&quot;, t, u)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::fmt::{Debug, Display};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn complex_function&#x3C;T, U>(t: &#x26;T, u: &#x26;U) -> String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    T: Display + Clone,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    U: Debug + Summary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    format!(\"{} - {:?}\", t, u)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"关联类型\">关联类型</h2><p>关联类型在 Trait 内部定义类型占位符，实现时指定具体类型。相比泛型参数，关联类型保证每个实现只有一种类型映射。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"trait Iterator {&#10;    type Item;&#10;&#10;    fn next(&amp;mut self) -&gt; Option&lt;Self::Item&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct Counter {&#10;    count: u32,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl Iterator for Counter {&#10;    type Item = u32;&#10;&#10;    fn next(&amp;mut self) -&gt; Option&lt;Self::Item&gt; {&#10;        if self.count &lt; 5 {&#10;            self.count += 1;&#10;            Some(self.count)&#10;        } else {&#10;            None&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>trait Iterator {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type Item;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn next(&#x26;mut self) -> Option&#x3C;Self::Item>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Counter {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    count: u32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Iterator for Counter {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type Item = u32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn next(&#x26;mut self) -> Option&#x3C;Self::Item> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if self.count &#x3C; 5 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            self.count += 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Some(self.count)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>泛型参数 <code>trait Foo&lt;T&gt;</code></th>\n<th>关联类型 <code>type Item</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每个类型的实现数量</td>\n<td>可以多个（不同 T）</td>\n<td>唯一一个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用时是否需要指定</td>\n<td>需要 <code>Foo&lt;i32&gt;</code></td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用途</td>\n<td><code>From&lt;T&gt;</code>, <code>Add&lt;Rhs&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>Iterator</code>, <code>Deref</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"静态分发与动态分发\">静态分发与动态分发</h2><p>Rust 提供两种多态分发机制，各有性能和灵活性的取舍。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[多态调用] --&gt; B{编译期已知类型?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[&quot;静态分发 impl Trait / 泛型&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[&quot;动态分发 dyn Trait&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;单态化: 每个类型生成专用代码&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;虚表 vtable: 运行时查找方法&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[多态调用] --&gt; B{编译期已知类型?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[\"静态分发 impl Trait / 泛型\"]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[\"动态分发 dyn Trait\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"单态化: 每个类型生成专用代码\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"虚表 vtable: 运行时查找方法\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn static_dispatch(item: &amp;impl Summary) {&#10;    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, item.summarize());&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn dynamic_dispatch(item: &amp;dyn Summary) {&#10;    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, item.summarize());&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn create_summarizers() -&gt; Vec&lt;Box&lt;dyn Summary&gt;&gt; {&#10;    vec![&#10;        Box::new(Article {&#10;            title: &quot;标题&quot;.into(),&#10;            author: &quot;作者&quot;.into(),&#10;            content: &quot;内容&quot;.into(),&#10;        }),&#10;    ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn static_dispatch(item: &#x26;impl Summary) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}\", item.summarize());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn dynamic_dispatch(item: &#x26;dyn Summary) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}\", item.summarize());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn create_summarizers() -> Vec&#x3C;Box&#x3C;dyn Summary>> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec![</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Box::new(Article {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            title: \"标题\".into(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            author: \"作者\".into(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            content: \"内容\".into(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分发方式</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>二进制大小</th>\n<th>灵活性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态分发（泛型）</td>\n<td>零开销，可内联</td>\n<td>较大（单态化膨胀）</td>\n<td>编译期确定类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态分发（<code>dyn</code>）</td>\n<td>虚表间接调用开销</td>\n<td>较小</td>\n<td>运行时异构集合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"blanket-implementation\">Blanket Implementation</h2><p>为所有满足条件的类型统一实现 Trait，是 Rust 标准库的核心模式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::fmt::Display;&#10;&#10;trait Greeting {&#10;    fn greet(&amp;self) -&gt; String;&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;T: Display&gt; Greeting for T {&#10;    fn greet(&amp;self) -&gt; String {&#10;        format!(&quot;你好, {}!&quot;, self)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, &quot;世界&quot;.greet());&#10;    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, 42.greet());&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::fmt::Display;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>trait Greeting {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn greet(&#x26;self) -> String;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;T: Display> Greeting for T {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn greet(&#x26;self) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        format!(\"你好, {}!\", self)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}\", \"世界\".greet());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}\", 42.greet());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>标准库中的经典 blanket implementation：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Trait</th>\n<th>Blanket 规则</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>ToString</code></td>\n<td><code>impl&lt;T: Display&gt; ToString for T</code></td>\n<td>任何实现 <code>Display</code> 的类型自动获得 <code>to_string()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Into&lt;U&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>impl&lt;T, U&gt; Into&lt;U&gt; for T where U: From&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>实现 <code>From</code> 自动获得 <code>Into</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>IntoIterator</code></td>\n<td>为 <code>&amp;Vec&lt;T&gt;</code> 等容器自动实现</td>\n<td>支持 <code>for</code> 循环语法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"常用标准库-trait\">常用标准库 Trait</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Trait</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>派生宏</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Debug</code></td>\n<td>调试输出 <code>{:?}</code></td>\n<td><code>#[derive(Debug)]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Clone</code></td>\n<td>显式深拷贝</td>\n<td><code>#[derive(Clone)]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Copy</code></td>\n<td>隐式按位复制</td>\n<td><code>#[derive(Copy)]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PartialEq</code> / <code>Eq</code></td>\n<td>相等比较</td>\n<td><code>#[derive(PartialEq, Eq)]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PartialOrd</code> / <code>Ord</code></td>\n<td>排序比较</td>\n<td><code>#[derive(PartialOrd, Ord)]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Hash</code></td>\n<td>哈希计算</td>\n<td><code>#[derive(Hash)]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Default</code></td>\n<td>默认值</td>\n<td><code>#[derive(Default)]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>From</code> / <code>Into</code></td>\n<td>类型转换</td>\n<td>手动实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Display</code></td>\n<td>用户友好输出 <code>{}</code></td>\n<td>手动实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Deref</code></td>\n<td>智能指针解引用</td>\n<td>手动实现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"泛型与生命周期结合\">泛型与生命周期结合</h2><p>泛型参数、Trait Bound 和生命周期可以组合使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::fmt::Display;&#10;&#10;struct Wrapper&lt;&#39;a, T: Display + &#39;a&gt; {&#10;    value: &amp;&#39;a T,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;&#39;a, T: Display&gt; Wrapper&lt;&#39;a, T&gt; {&#10;    fn show(&amp;self) {&#10;        println!(&quot;包装值: {}&quot;, self.value);&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn longest_with_display&lt;&#39;a, T&gt;(x: &amp;&#39;a T, y: &amp;&#39;a T) -&gt; &amp;&#39;a T&#10;where&#10;    T: Display + PartialOrd,&#10;{&#10;    if x &gt;= y { x } else { y }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::fmt::Display;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Wrapper&#x3C;'a, T: Display + 'a> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    value: &#x26;'a T,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;'a, T: Display> Wrapper&#x3C;'a, T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn show(&#x26;self) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"包装值: {}\", self.value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn longest_with_display&#x3C;'a, T>(x: &#x26;'a T, y: &#x26;'a T) -> &#x26;'a T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    T: Display + PartialOrd,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if x >= y { x } else { y }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Trait 描述能力、泛型复用代码，两者共同实现<strong>编译期多态</strong>，且不依赖继承层级。</li>\n<li>Trait Bound 有三种写法：<code>impl Trait</code>、泛型 + Bound、<code>where</code> 子句，按约束复杂度选择。</li>\n<li>关联类型适合&quot;每个实现只有一种映射&quot;（如 <code>Iterator::Item</code>），泛型参数适合&quot;同一类型多种映射&quot;（如 <code>From&lt;T&gt;</code>）。</li>\n<li>静态分发零开销、可内联，代价是单态化导致的二进制膨胀；动态分发用虚表换取更小的体积与运行时异构集合的支持。</li>\n<li>Blanket implementation 让&quot;实现 <code>Display</code> 即自动获得 <code>ToString</code>&quot;这类能力自动传播，是标准库扩展性的核心手段。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Trait 与泛型","id":"trait-与泛型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Trait 基础","id":"trait-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"泛型与 Trait Bound","id":"泛型与-trait-bound"},{"level":3,"text":"Trait Bound 的三种写法","id":"trait-bound-的三种写法"},{"level":2,"text":"关联类型","id":"关联类型"},{"level":2,"text":"静态分发与动态分发","id":"静态分发与动态分发"},{"level":2,"text":"Blanket Implementation","id":"blanket-implementation"},{"level":2,"text":"常用标准库 Trait","id":"常用标准库-trait"},{"level":2,"text":"泛型与生命周期结合","id":"泛型与生命周期结合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"智能指针","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/ownership-and-borrowing/smart-pointers"},"next":{"title":"枚举与模式匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/type-system/enums-and-pattern-matching"}}